    "profile_title": "Strong, Fast & Efficient, Multi-color, Sizes",
    "profile_notes": "I've completely optimized this oversized profile to give you the best balance of speed, strength, and filament efficiency. Maximized Strength & Speed: Upgraded to double external walls (0.8mm) for a highly durable shell that prints faster. Optimized Infill: Carefully tuned infill density to maintain structural integrity while using less filament. Vibrant Multi-Color: Fully set up for standard Dual Color, with Fast Dual Color options included. Multiple Sizes: Large and Extra Large sizes available. High-Yield Layout: Improved plate placement maximizes the quantity you can print in a single batch",
